Spec: Public manifest semantics

Purpose:
  Return immutable public declarations and normalized policies only after their complete semantic contract holds.

Owns:
  ./ManifestContract.java

References:
  ./StrictJson.sdd
  ./ApplicationManifest.java
  ./ConnectionPolicy.java
  ./ContractException.java
  /docs/adr/0001-public-contract-normalization.md

Must:
  Validate field sets, required types, identifiers, loopback targets, authorities, health checks and unique service declarations.
  Apply mode-specific policy defaults and reject inconsistent waits, relay permissions or uint64 budgets.
  Count string limits as Unicode scalars and preserve declaration array order.
  Return @ContractException with code `INVALID_REQUEST` and no reflected input or parser cause when validation fails.

Exposes:
  @ManifestContract.parse
  @ManifestContract.normalizePolicy

Done when:
  Shared accepted cases match expected normalized objects and rejected cases expose only the stable error code.
